    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "## Exploring the Network Tab\n\nIn Level 6, you'll look at a call made to a weather API. \n\nClick through the following panels to learn how to access the **Network** tab and view the **Response Data**.\n\n**Note:** These panels show an example of a call made to the Pokemon API. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/7c7a9feca6443b38fb7f50664a2721a9-Screenshot 2026-02-27 at 1.12.52 PM.png",
        "key": "designing-reliable-apps-lesson1-level1-networks-panel-2025-pilot-971efea8-62fe-4c25-8789-7dbc0de296ad",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Make an API call\n\nIf the data is not already displayed, make sure to **fetch the data** and have it appear on screen.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a007f95367d6b449a00c831d737477b9-api_call.gif",
        "key": "designing-reliable-apps-lesson1-level1-networks-panel-2025-pilot-8a6c1963-9eeb-4903-84db-4654f9e04b3e",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Open the Network Panel\n\nLocate the **debug panel** button on the top right of your screen and click it. \n\nThen toggle from **Console** to **Network**.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c559b269cc327e1d878f507664ffc8a1-open_networks.gif",
        "key": "designing-reliable-apps-lesson1-level1-networks-panel-2025-pilot-9a5338b3-3f99-4ccc-958b-c98f8ff8135a",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Resize the Panel\n\nUse the **resize tool** to make the Network panel larger.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ba63b24a939b0800926ecf6303d8021b-resize.gif",
        "key": "designing-reliable-apps-lesson1-level1-networks-panel-2025-pilot-02f5916f-0f86-479c-ac78-7b2f0f09ffe6"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Explore Response Data\n\nSkim through the **`Response Data`** JSON file.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2a97dd13c249908a3742bc5f6006dc86-explore_response_data.gif",
        "key": "designing-reliable-apps-lesson1-level1-networks-panel-2025-pilot-2b241c0a-7d23-4faf-977c-c85c8fa8a7db"
      }
    ]
  },
